<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Personal Health — Wellness</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/wellness.css">
  <script src="/config.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="logo">
      <span class="logo-mark">PH</span>
      <span class="logo-name">Personal Health</span>
    </div>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a class="nav-item" href="/">Overview</a>
      <a class="nav-item" href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
      <a class="nav-item active" href="/wellness">Wellness</a>
      <a class="nav-item" href="/map">Map</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="sidebar-status">
      <span class="dot <%= backendOnline ? 'green' : 'red' %>"></span>
      <span><%= backendOnline ? 'Backend online' : 'Backend offline' %></span>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <main class="main">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div>
        <h1>Wellness</h1>
        <p class="sub">Nutrition, sleep &amp; recovery tracking</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/dashboard" class="btn">Back to Dashboard</a>
    </div>

  <!-- Wellness Trends Chart -->
    <div style="background:#1e2433; padding:24px; border-radius:12px; margin-bottom:24px;">
      <h2 style="color:#ffffff; font-family:Inter,sans-serif; font-size:18px; margin:0 0 4px 0;">Team Wellness Trends</h2>
      <p style="color:#94a3b8; font-family:Inter,sans-serif; font-size:14px; margin:0 0 20px 0;">4-week team average — wellness & sleep scores</p>
      <canvas id="wellnessChart" height="80"></canvas>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.0/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
    <script>
      (function() {
        const labels = ['Week 1', 'Week 2', 'Week 3', 'Week 4'];
        const wellnessData = [65, 72, 68, 75];
        const sleepData    = [60, 66, 70, 73];

        new Chart(document.getElementById('wellnessChart'), {
          type: 'line',
          data: {
            labels: labels,
            datasets: [
              {
                label: 'Avg Wellness Score',
                data: wellnessData,
                borderColor: '#00e5ff',
                backgroundColor: 'rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.08)',
                borderWidth: 2,
                pointBackgroundColor: '#00e5ff',
                pointRadius: 5,
                tension: 0.3,
                fill: true
              },
              {
                label: 'Avg Sleep Score',
                data: sleepData,
                borderColor: '#00e676',
                backgroundColor: 'rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.08)',
                borderWidth: 2,
                pointBackgroundColor: '#00e676',
                pointRadius: 5,
                tension: 0.3,
                fill: true
              },
              {
                label: 'Ready Threshold (70)',
                data: [70, 70, 70, 70],
                borderColor: 'rgba(255, 80, 80, 0.85)',
                borderWidth: 2,
                borderDash: [6, 4],
                pointRadius: 0,
                fill: false
              }
            ]
          },
          options: {
            responsive: true,
            plugins: {
              legend: {
                labels: {
                  color: '#ffffff',
                  font: { family: 'Inter', size: 13 }
                }
              }
            },
            scales: {
              x: {
                ticks: { color: '#94a3b8', font: { family: 'Inter' } },
                grid:  { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)' }
              },
              y: {
                min: 0,
                max: 100,
                ticks: { color: '#94a3b8', font: { family: 'Inter' } },
                grid:  { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)' }
              }
            }
          }
        });
      })();
    </script>
 <div class="coming-soon-card">
      <div class="coming-soon-icon">
        <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round">
          <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h2>Wellness Dashboard</h2>
      <p>Coming soon — the team is building nutrition tracking, sleep analysis, and recovery scoring.</p>
      <div class="feature-list">
        <div class="feature-item">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"/></svg>
          <span>Meal logging with Indian food database</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="2"><path d="M23 6l-9.5 9.5-5-5L1 18"/></svg>
          <span>Sleep quality tracking and trends</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
          <span>Recovery readiness before every session</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/dashboard" class="back-link">View Dashboard</a>
    </div>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
